[00:01.32] O Fortuna
[00:07.62] Velut luna
[00:13.81] Statu variabilis
[00:24.84] Semper crescis
[00:27.16] Aut decrescis
[00:29.93] Vita detestabilis
[00:35.02] Nunc obdurat
[00:37.43] Et tunc curat
[00:40.21] Ludo mentis aciem
[00:45.57] Egestatem
[00:48.22] Potestatem
[00:50.73] Dissolvit ut glaciem
[00:55.83] Sors immanis
[00:58.58] Et inanis
[01:00.86] Rota tu volubilis
[01:06.09] Status malus
[01:08.44] Vana salus
[01:11.30] Semper dissolubilis
[01:16.47] Obumbrata
[01:18.89] Et velata
[01:21.68] Michi quoque niteris
[01:26.80] Nunc per ludum
[01:29.23] Dorsum nudum
[01:31.87] Fero tui sceleris
[01:36.96] Sors salutis
[01:39.06] Et virtutis
[01:42.02] Michi nunc contraria
[01:47.05] Est affectus
[01:49.73] Et defectus
[01:52.18] Semper in angaria
[01:56.81] Hac in hora
[01:59.96] Sine mora
[02:02.38] Corde pulsum tangite
[02:07.44] Quod per sortem
[02:10.19] Sternit fortem
[02:12.55] Mecum omnes plangite
[05:19.06] 